# Banners: a boss felled, then the classic death
Output images/demo/banner.gif
Source docs/tapes/settings.tape
Hide
Type `cd "$DEMO_REPO" && clear && nvim --cmd "luafile $DEMO_LUA" lua/init.lua`
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type ":Banner felled"
Enter
Sleep 4500ms
Type ":Banner died"
Enter
Sleep 4500ms
